## Execution

Use the manifest-aware runner to execute the recipe:

```bash
sumpter recipes run extract <workspace> \
  --input-path ./testdata \
  --output-path ./outputs/journal.json
```

The manifest provides defaults for signature/extract configs, input discovery, and output format. Override anything at the command line as needed.

For low-level debugging you can still call the extract command directly:

```bash
sumpter extract files \
  --signature-config-path signature/example-signature.yaml \
  --extract-config-path extract/example-extract.yaml \
  --files testdata/sample.xml
```

